graph TD
    A[Growth Signal] --> B[Nutrient Availability]
    B --> C[TORC1 Activation]
    C --> D[Cln3 Synthesis]
    D --> E[Cln3-Cdk1 Complex]
    E --> F[Whi5 Phosphorylation]
    F --> G[Whi5 Export]
    G --> H[SBF/MBF Activation]
    H --> I[G1/S Gene Transcription]
    I --> J[Cln1/2 Synthesis]
    J --> K[Cln1/2-Cdk1 Complex]
    K --> L[Start Commitment]
    L --> M[G1/S Transition Complete]
    
    %% Alternative pathway
    A --> N[Stress Signal]
    N --> O[TORC1 Inhibition]
    O --> P[G1 Arrest]
    P --> Q[Cell Cycle Arrest]
    
    %% Regulation
    M --> R[Cell Cycle Status]
    R --> S{Proceed to S Phase?}
    S -->|Yes| T[S Phase Entry]
    S -->|No| U[G1 Arrest]
    
    %% Key proteins
    V[TORC1] --> C
    W[Cln3] --> D
    X[Cln1/2] --> J
    Y[Whi5] --> F
    Z[SBF/MBF] --> H
    AA[Cdk1] --> E
    BB[Start Factors] --> L
    
